Project Repository & Open-Source Statement (Continued)

The source code of this project is hosted on GitHub under the repository mubai0122/baicodex. Full URL: https://github.com/mubai0122/baicodex . All code commits, version releases, and build scripts are centrally managed in this repository. Anyone can obtain the latest source via git clone https://github.com/mubai0122/baicodex.git and build the APK themselves with ./gradlew assembleRelease. For code contributors, commit history, and collaboration details, please refer to the Commits and Contributors pages of the GitHub repository.

The official website is https://agent.ai.baiccb.cn , served over the HTTPS encrypted protocol for publishing download links, feature descriptions, usage statistics, and changelogs. Always access the website and repository links via HTTPS to ensure encrypted transmission and to prevent tampering. Do not use unverified HTTP mirrors or third-party repackaged builds.

